# Evidence logs are the exception: summarize_benchmarks.py, summarize_phase1.py and
# summarize_training_rate.py parse exactly these to rebuild the published artifacts in benchmarks/,
# so a clone without them cannot reproduce any number that the README quotes from them. New
# experiment logs stay ignored.
